---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
    <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
        <a href="/" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 text-sm font-semibold mb-8 inline-block">&larr; Back to Home</a>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Privacy Policy: FlexList</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-8 font-mono">Last updated: August 2026</p>
        
        <section class="space-y-6 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
                GS-APPS built the <strong>FlexList</strong> app as a Freemium application. This SERVICE is provided by GS-APPS at no cost for a 30-day trial period, after which ad support is enabled, with an option for a one-time lifetime in-app purchase to permanently remove advertisements.
            </p>
            <p>
                This page informs visitors regarding our policies concerning the collection, use, and disclosure of personal information if anyone decides to use our Service.
            </p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">Information Storage & Processing</h2>
            <p>
                FlexList is designed with a <strong>privacy-first, offline-first architecture</strong>. All user-generated content—including your custom lists, rich notes, task statuses, and reminder dates—is stored strictly on your local physical device using encrypted local database storage (Hive).
            </p>
            <p>
                We do not require account creation, email registration, or login credentials to use FlexList. We do not operate remote databases to store or synchronize your private notes and lists.
            </p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">Third-Party Services</h2>
            <p>
                To support app monetization and facilitate digital purchase verification, FlexList integrates select official third-party software development kits (SDKs) provided by Google. These third-party services may collect non-personally identifiable telemetry to function properly:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 pl-4 text-slate-300">
                <li>
                    <strong>Google Mobile Ads (AdMob):</strong> Displays banner advertisements upon the expiration of the 30-day trial. AdMob may collect device identifiers (such as the Android Advertising ID), app interaction metrics, diagnostics, and approximate location (derived from IP address) for ad delivery, analytics, and fraud prevention.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Google Play In-App Billing:</strong> Facilitates the optional one-time purchase to permanently remove ads. All payment transactions are processed directly and securely by Google Play. GS-APPS does not store, collect, or have access to your credit card details or financial information.
                </li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">Local Notifications</h2>
            <p>
                FlexList allows you to set local scheduled reminders for lists and notes. Notification timers are managed locally by your device's operating system. No notification data or schedule information is transmitted off your device.
            </p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">Children's Privacy</h2>
            <p>
                These Services do not address anyone under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from children under 13.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">Security</h2>
            <p>
                We value your trust in using FlexList. Since all your application data remains locally on your phone, your data security is tied directly to your physical device security. All third-party SDK network transmissions (ad delivery and purchase verification) are conducted over secure, encrypted HTTPS channels.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
            <p>
                We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. You are advised to review this page periodically for any changes. We will notify users of any updates by posting the revised Privacy Policy on this page.
            </p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">Contact Us</h2>
            <p>
                If you have any questions or suggestions regarding our Privacy Policy or FlexList, please contact us at: 
                <a href="mailto:schumigeos@gmail.com" class="text-emerald-400 hover:underline">schumigeos@gmail.com</a>.
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>
</Layout>